(InsightForge AI Test Document - Page 1) Tj T*
(Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) is a branch of computer science focused on building smart machines capable of performing tasks that typically require human intelligence, such as reasoning, learning, and problem-solving. The characteristics of Artificial Intelligence include adaptability, pattern recognition, decision-making capabilities, automated processing, and continuous learning from past data.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
