(Vector Databases and Semantic Search) Tj T*
(Dense retrieval models convert text chunks into high-dimensional vector embeddings. FAISS \(Facebook AI Similarity Search\) enables high-performance vector search for semantic document retrieval.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
