(InsightForge AI Test Document - Page 6) Tj T*
(What is an intelligent system?) Tj T*
(An intelligent system is a system that perceives its environment through sensors, processes information using reasoning rules or learning algorithms, takes rational actions to maximize success, and adapts its performance over time.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
