(InsightForge AI Test Document - Page 7) Tj T*
(Knowledge Representation) Tj T*
(Knowledge representation in AI involves structuring human knowledge using formal logics, ontologies, semantic networks, and knowledge graphs so intelligent agents can perform automated reasoning.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
