(InsightForge AI Test Document - Page 8) Tj T*
(What are the applications of Artificial Intelligence?) Tj T*
(The applications of Artificial Intelligence span healthcare medical diagnostics, autonomous transportation, financial fraud detection, natural language processing, robotics, automated document intelligence, and personalized recommendation systems.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
