(InsightForge AI Test Document - Page 11) Tj T*
(What are the current trends in Artificial Intelligence?) Tj T*
(The current trends in Artificial Intelligence include Large Language Models \(LLMs\), Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\), local edge AI inference, multimodal foundation models, autonomous agentic workflows, and AI alignment.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
