(InsightForge AI Test Document - Page 14) Tj T*
(What are the characteristics of problems in Artificial Intelligence?) Tj T*
(The characteristics of problems in Artificial Intelligence include high state-space complexity, incomplete or uncertain information, dynamic environments, non-deterministic state transitions, and multi-objective optimization trade-offs.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
